  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Pro Line Black, formerly known as Pro Line II, is a tournament-oriented co-polyester monofilament engineered to combine power, control and spin with consistent dynamic response and strong tension maintenance. Developed from decades of Kirschbaum string manufacturing expertise, it provides predictable performance for aggressive competitive players. The 1.15 and 1.20 mm gauges emphasize feel and response, 1.25 mm provides the best overall balance, and 1.30 mm maximizes durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Pro Line Black（原 Pro Line II）是一款面向竞技和比赛球员的共聚酯单丝球线，在力量、控制和旋转之间提供出色平衡。它基于 Kirschbaum 多年的球线制造经验开发，核心优势包括稳定的动态反馈和优秀的保磅性能，使球员在比赛过程中获得持续、可预测的击球表现。1.15 和 1.20 毫米版本更强调手感与响应；1.25 毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30 毫米则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

